WEBVTT

00:14.920 --> 00:16.890
M-Morning, Mie-san.

00:16.890 --> 00:17.910
Komura-kun.

00:17.910 --> 00:18.740
Morning.

00:19.420 --> 00:20.400
Shoot...

00:20.860 --> 00:24.540
I was trying not to forget 
my glasses on rainy days.

00:24.540 --> 00:27.000
Does it make it even harder to see?

00:27.560 --> 00:28.320
Yeah.

00:28.320 --> 00:32.230
So I have to keep my eyes 
forward and walk carefully.

00:32.230 --> 00:33.520
Your feet!

00:52.030 --> 00:53.770
It's so gross.

00:53.770 --> 00:56.740
I wonder if there are spare socks 
or something at the nurse's office.

00:58.340 --> 01:01.560
We aren't switching classrooms today, are we?

01:01.560 --> 01:02.330
We aren't.

01:08.790 --> 01:11.950
Komura-kun, could you face 
the other way for a second?

01:11.950 --> 01:13.840
Huh? Okay.

01:29.550 --> 01:30.680
Ruffle, ruffle...

01:34.120 --> 01:35.340
All done.

01:36.390 --> 01:37.240
Okay.

01:37.990 --> 01:40.240
I'm throwing out my socks today.

01:51.990 --> 01:52.810
Hm?

01:52.810 --> 01:53.840
Komura-kun?

01:53.840 --> 01:55.510
You can look now.

01:55.510 --> 01:56.260
Err...

01:56.260 --> 02:00.540
I'll watch the rain for today.

02:00.540 --> 02:01.850
I like it.

02:01.850 --> 02:02.970
The rain, I mean.

02:10.730 --> 02:11.810
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

02:11.810 --> 02:14.820
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

03:33.980 --> 03:38.990
Episode 8

03:33.980 --> 03:38.990
The Girl I Like and I

03:33.980 --> 03:38.990
Saw A Confession Together

03:43.330 --> 03:46.460
Respect local 
residents. 
No barbecues
 or fires.

03:52.710 --> 03:55.010
<i>Wh-What's going on with her?</i>

03:55.010 --> 03:57.200
<i>Is it all right to talk to her?</i>

04:02.020 --> 04:02.720
<i>She found me.</i>

04:03.670 --> 04:05.710
I forgot my keys.

04:05.710 --> 04:08.260
I'm waiting for Mom to get home.

04:08.730 --> 04:09.920
I see.

04:10.780 --> 04:13.270
I thought it was something serious.

04:13.510 --> 04:16.690
Oh, hey, could you push me on the swing?

04:16.690 --> 04:18.570
Me?

04:18.570 --> 04:19.570
Yeah.

04:19.570 --> 04:22.070
Okay, let's race to that tree!

04:21.520 --> 04:23.820
I haven't had someone push me in a long time.

04:22.070 --> 04:23.820
Hold up!

04:24.200 --> 04:26.180
<i>W-Wait...</i>

04:26.180 --> 04:27.190
<i>How...</i>

04:27.190 --> 04:29.170
<i>How do you push someone on a swing again?</i>

04:29.170 --> 04:31.830
<i>D-Do I push her back?</i>

04:32.130 --> 04:36.830
<i>I-Is that all right to do before marriage?</i>

04:52.350 --> 04:53.220
<i>Huh?</i>

04:53.750 --> 04:54.810
<i>Isn't she...</i>

04:57.020 --> 05:01.660
<i>Exposing herself in front?</i>

05:08.280 --> 05:12.510
<i>That's no reason to stop her 
suddenly! I'm such an idiot!</i>

05:12.510 --> 05:13.590
What's wrong?

05:13.590 --> 05:16.290
S-Sorry, the wind...

05:28.140 --> 05:32.160
Oh, don't worry. I'm wearing pants.

05:33.340 --> 05:34.010
See?

05:44.060 --> 05:47.640
I hope I wasn't too heavy.

05:47.640 --> 05:49.820
How much do I weigh right now again?

05:53.340 --> 05:54.750
Totally.

05:54.750 --> 05:55.330
About that...

05:57.120 --> 05:58.780
There.

06:01.780 --> 06:02.910
Komura-kun.

06:03.430 --> 06:05.340
You dropped something.

06:05.340 --> 06:06.150
Sorry.

06:06.150 --> 06:07.140
Thanks.

06:08.840 --> 06:10.470
<i>My app store card!</i>

06:10.470 --> 06:13.330
<i>She's going to think I spend a ton 
of money on game micro-transactions!</i>

06:13.330 --> 06:15.530
<i>She's going to think I'm a loser!</i>

06:15.530 --> 06:16.680
<i>I'm not!</i>

06:16.680 --> 06:18.850
<i>I only spend up to a thousand yen a month!</i>

06:19.340 --> 06:20.490
What's this?

06:20.490 --> 06:21.860
U-Um...

06:21.860 --> 06:23.220
<i>Right.</i>

06:23.220 --> 06:25.360
<i>Mie-san doesn't know about 
social media games or anything.</i>

06:26.030 --> 06:28.360
<i>Or maybe she just can't see it.</i>

06:29.390 --> 06:31.370
It's an apple card.

06:31.980 --> 06:33.550
A what card?

06:35.010 --> 06:36.340
You like it?

06:36.340 --> 06:37.800
Well, I guess.

06:37.800 --> 06:38.470
Here.

06:39.390 --> 06:40.400
Thanks.

06:46.900 --> 06:47.760
Are you okay?

06:48.100 --> 06:50.300
<i>I didn't give a straight answer.</i>

06:50.850 --> 06:52.220
<i>Sorry, Mie-san!</i>

06:53.060 --> 06:58.110
<i>But it would be selfish of me to expose her 
to the heathen culture of social media games.</i>

06:58.110 --> 06:59.440
Time to eat.

06:59.860 --> 07:04.260
<i>I hope she doesn't think more of it;
 it's just an apple card.</i>

07:04.260 --> 07:05.180
<i>But...</i>

07:08.310 --> 07:09.490
Komura-kun.

07:16.530 --> 07:17.490
You can have it.

07:21.860 --> 07:23.110
N-No?

07:23.110 --> 07:24.610
Is that not it?

07:25.720 --> 07:27.090
<b>Question</b>

07:26.100 --> 07:27.010
<i>Question:</i>

07:27.970 --> 07:31.840
<i>K-kun would like to limit his monthly 
micro-transactions to 1,000 yen.</i>

07:27.970 --> 07:37.100
<b>K-kun would like to limit his monthly micro-transactions
 to 1,000 yen. An apple card starts at 1,500 yen. 
What should he do?</b>

07:31.840 --> 07:35.490
<i>An apple card starts at 1,500 yen.</i>

07:35.490 --> 07:37.100
<i>What should he do?</i>

07:37.100 --> 07:39.100
<b>Answer</b>

07:37.570 --> 07:39.100
<i>Answer:</i>

07:39.100 --> 07:42.020
1st month

07:39.680 --> 07:43.870
<i>Buy a 1,500 yen card on the 
first and second months,</i>

07:39.810 --> 07:42.020
2nd month

07:42.020 --> 07:52.610
1st month

07:42.020 --> 07:52.610
2nd month

07:42.940 --> 07:52.610
3rd month

07:43.870 --> 07:46.730
<i>and avoid buying one on the third month.</i>

07:45.440 --> 07:52.610
3000 yen

07:46.730 --> 07:51.000
<i>That way, he'll have used 
3,000 yen over 3 months.</i>

07:51.000 --> 07:52.610
<i>Repeat as necessary.</i>

07:52.610 --> 07:56.120
Y-You can have this.

07:56.120 --> 07:58.290
I mean, I like apples.

07:58.290 --> 07:59.650
I do, but...

07:59.650 --> 08:02.120
I'd like you to have this.

08:14.600 --> 08:15.860
Hello?

08:15.860 --> 08:17.550
<i>Oh, Asuka-chan?</i>

08:17.550 --> 08:20.740
<i>Sorry, I don't know where the washroom is.</i>

08:22.740 --> 08:23.810
Mie-san?

08:23.810 --> 08:26.220
<i>Huh? Komura-kun?</i>

08:26.220 --> 08:26.810
<i>Huh?!</i>

08:27.540 --> 08:28.890
<i>I messed up.</i>

08:28.890 --> 08:30.490
<i>Sorry to call you so late.</i>

08:30.490 --> 08:31.670
No, it's fine.

08:31.670 --> 08:32.270
I was up.

08:32.350 --> 08:33.280
I was up.

08:33.550 --> 08:35.360
<i>I'm really sorry.</i>

08:35.360 --> 08:37.090
<i>Good night, Komura-kun.</i>

08:38.230 --> 08:39.360
Y-Yeah.

08:48.020 --> 08:49.340
Komura here.

08:49.990 --> 08:51.960
U-Umm...

08:56.320 --> 08:57.060
Wait...

08:58.090 --> 09:00.970
If I can help...

09:01.460 --> 09:02.470
But...

09:02.470 --> 09:04.030
<i>It's all right.</i>

09:04.030 --> 09:04.980
<i>I was up.</i>

09:05.720 --> 09:10.230
So I'm sleeping over at 
Asuka-chan's place right now.

09:10.530 --> 09:14.580
<i>I couldn't find my glasses, so I decided 
to go to the washroom without them.</i>

09:14.580 --> 09:17.340
<i>But I didn't think it would 
be so dark and hard to see.</i>

09:17.340 --> 09:18.370
<i>And scary.</i>

09:18.890 --> 09:20.950
So I gave up half way.

09:20.950 --> 09:23.000
<i>I-I see.</i>

09:23.910 --> 09:30.020
I feel like going forward instead of 
giving up, now that I've come this far...

09:30.020 --> 09:30.810
<i>Err...</i>

09:30.810 --> 09:32.250
<i>Is it pitch black?</i>

09:32.530 --> 09:35.020
Are there no light switches 
or anything nearby?

09:35.020 --> 09:36.130
<i>Let's see...</i>

09:36.770 --> 09:39.010
<i>Oh, my ribbon got stuck.</i>

09:39.690 --> 09:42.440
<i>Mie-san's pajamas have ribbons on them.</i>

09:42.440 --> 09:46.890
Komura-kun, could you sing something?

09:48.150 --> 09:54.150
The sleepover today was a horror 
movie party, and it was hell.

09:54.420 --> 09:55.840
R-Right.

09:55.840 --> 09:59.910
<i>I said I didn't want to watch, but 
Asuka-chan was pushy about it.</i>

10:01.110 --> 10:02.660
Asuka-chan sucks.

10:03.350 --> 10:05.390
<i>I wish Mie-san would tell me I suck.</i>

10:05.390 --> 10:08.670
<i>Sing for me to distract me.</i>

10:10.360 --> 10:12.170
Sing? A song?

10:13.010 --> 10:14.170
Just a second.

10:15.210 --> 10:19.510
<i>To the school we go, where 
we learn of righteousness...</i>

10:19.510 --> 10:20.430
The school song?!

10:22.010 --> 10:23.060
<i>The school song!</i>

10:24.090 --> 10:25.220
<i>She's laughing.</i>

10:26.540 --> 10:27.980
<i>Shoot!</i>

10:27.980 --> 10:29.790
<i>Mom's awake!</i>

10:29.790 --> 10:30.800
<i>Is she just going to the washroom?!</i>

10:30.800 --> 10:32.610
<i>Please just be to go to the washroom!</i>

10:33.480 --> 10:35.110
Komura-kun?!

10:35.110 --> 10:38.240
<i>Mom's gonna find out if I talk now!</i>

10:38.810 --> 10:40.150
Did you fall asleep?

10:40.150 --> 10:41.880
Sing me the school song.

10:41.880 --> 10:43.240
Did you fall asleep?!

10:43.240 --> 10:45.490
Mie-san

10:43.980 --> 10:45.490
<i>I've confused her!</i>

10:45.860 --> 10:48.340
<i>I can't allow Mie-san to be scared.</i>

10:48.340 --> 10:51.800
<i>I have to whisper so that 
my mom doesn't hear!</i>

10:59.510 --> 11:00.510
Mie-san.

11:08.990 --> 11:12.200
<i>Wait, that might have been pretty creepy...</i>

11:13.770 --> 11:15.350
<i>Mom's leaving.</i>

11:16.740 --> 11:18.400
<i>Komura-kun?</i>

11:18.400 --> 11:20.000
S-Sorry, Mie-san.

11:20.000 --> 11:21.280
I just muted myself.

11:21.720 --> 11:23.050
By accident.

11:23.050 --> 11:24.370
<i>You did?</i>

11:25.300 --> 11:28.140
<i>I thought you fell asleep 
singing the school song.</i>

11:28.140 --> 11:29.000
<i>She's laughing.</i>

11:29.550 --> 11:33.380
<i>Oh, right, Mie-san, you could 
use the light on your phone.</i>

11:34.170 --> 11:36.000
Talk about a blind spot.

11:38.380 --> 11:40.930
<i>Blind spot number two.</i>

11:41.440 --> 11:42.380
Huh?

11:43.200 --> 11:44.390
I found the bathroom.

11:45.240 --> 11:46.390
Good.

11:51.070 --> 11:53.140
Err, M-Mie-san...

11:53.140 --> 11:56.070
<i>Oh, I'm going to mute my phone for a bit.</i>

11:57.070 --> 11:57.650
Yeah.

11:59.130 --> 12:00.330
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

12:00.330 --> 12:01.870
Oh, wait.

12:01.870 --> 12:03.180
First...

12:08.620 --> 12:09.970
Komura-kun.

12:14.830 --> 12:17.420
<i>Sorry, that startled me a bit.</i>

12:17.420 --> 12:18.120
Right?

12:18.120 --> 12:19.840
It's startling, isn't it?

12:26.430 --> 12:27.940
<i>Are you back in the bedroom?</i>

12:27.940 --> 12:29.600
Yeah, I made it.

12:30.360 --> 12:32.390
<i>Sorry, Komura-kun.</i>

12:32.780 --> 12:35.210
<i>For making you put up with me so much.</i>

12:35.210 --> 12:36.630
No, it's fine.

12:36.630 --> 12:37.540
Don't worry about it.

12:37.540 --> 12:38.400
I was awake.

12:38.910 --> 12:41.410
<i>I wish I could talk with her until morning.</i>

12:41.410 --> 12:43.310
<i>Well, I'm hanging up now.</i>

12:43.310 --> 12:44.400
Y-Yeah.

12:51.550 --> 12:52.720
Good night.

12:56.940 --> 13:00.420
<i>Mie-san's pajamas have ribbons on them.</i>

13:31.750 --> 13:34.380
<i>Mie-san forgot her glasses today.</i>

13:34.380 --> 13:36.580
<i>I wonder if she'll be all right in the pool.</i>

13:36.930 --> 13:37.750
<i>Wait, hang on.</i>

13:37.750 --> 13:41.590
<i>What do people who wear glasses 
do when they go to the pool?</i>

13:41.910 --> 13:44.390
<i>I don't think they'd swim 
with their glasses on.</i>

13:44.390 --> 13:46.310
<i>I hadn't even thought about it until now.</i>

13:46.310 --> 13:48.090
<i>It's Mie-san.</i>

13:50.800 --> 13:51.980
<i>Goggles?</i>

13:51.980 --> 13:54.960
<i>Oh, they must be prescription goggles.</i>

13:54.960 --> 13:56.600
<i>I heard they exist.</i>

13:57.220 --> 13:58.360
<i>I see.</i>

13:58.360 --> 13:59.760
<i>There're so many things to consider.</i>

13:59.760 --> 14:00.850
Komura.

14:03.010 --> 14:05.150
I get it, but....

14:05.150 --> 14:06.820
You're staring a bit too hard.

14:27.390 --> 14:30.350
He wanted to shout,
"It's not what you think"

14:27.580 --> 14:30.340
<i>He wanted to shout "It's not what you think,"</i>

14:30.390 --> 14:40.070
but being that he appreciated
 it even only for a moment,
 he couldn't entirely deny it.

14:30.870 --> 14:36.770
<i>but being that he appreciated it even if 
only for a moment, he couldn't entirely deny it.</i>

14:36.400 --> 14:40.070
And so, Komura-kun cried.

14:36.770 --> 14:38.730
<i>And so, Komura-kun cried.</i>

14:46.610 --> 14:49.610
<i>I'm only going to pay for games once a month.</i>

14:53.830 --> 14:55.120
M-Mie-san.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.370
Komura-kun.

15:00.570 --> 15:03.540
D-Don't tell anyone I'm 
snacking on my way home.

15:03.540 --> 15:05.430
I bought some snacks, too.

15:14.600 --> 15:16.620
<i>Mie-san under the sun...</i>

15:17.140 --> 15:18.460
<i>So aesthetic.</i>

15:20.100 --> 15:21.850
<b>Win</b>

15:20.520 --> 15:21.850
<i>She won!</i>

15:23.080 --> 15:25.110
Mie-san, that's...

15:39.940 --> 15:43.030
Err, you won. Your stick.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.720
Oh, you're right.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.330
It says something.

15:47.330 --> 15:49.050
I didn't see that.

15:49.050 --> 15:50.840
It's fun when you get a win, huh?

15:51.940 --> 15:53.590
Y-Yeah.

15:54.030 --> 15:55.330
Do you like wins?

15:56.000 --> 15:57.720
Sure. It feels good.

15:59.680 --> 16:00.660
You can have it.

16:06.060 --> 16:06.980
Bye-bye.

16:42.430 --> 16:43.810
<i>It's a cat.</i>

16:43.810 --> 16:45.490
<i>Must have wandered in.</i>

16:49.520 --> 16:52.760
<i>Cats don't really look like shopping bags.</i>

16:52.760 --> 16:56.310
<i>But shopping bags do
look like cats. Weird.</i>

16:58.840 --> 17:02.110
<i>I just had a Mie-san philosophy moment.</i>

17:13.470 --> 17:15.920
<i>Th-That was Azuma-kun right?</i>

17:15.920 --> 17:17.470
<i>I don't know the girl.</i>

17:19.510 --> 17:20.440
<i>Huh?!</i>

17:20.440 --> 17:21.790
<i>Behind the gym?!</i>

17:21.790 --> 17:24.820
<i>Does that actually happen outside of manga?!</i>

17:25.350 --> 17:26.780
Um...

17:26.780 --> 17:27.480
Yeah?

17:28.230 --> 17:30.460
<i>What do I do?!</i>

17:34.070 --> 17:35.320
There's a cat there.

17:35.320 --> 17:37.360
Th-There is.

17:41.170 --> 17:43.350
<i>If only I could become a cat...</i>

17:43.350 --> 17:45.630
<i>I could just meow my way out of here.</i>

17:52.730 --> 17:54.290
<i>M-Mie-san!</i>

17:54.290 --> 17:55.550
<i>Why is she here?!</i>

17:59.050 --> 18:01.200
<i>It's your fault!</i>

18:02.460 --> 18:04.140
<i>Crap, crap, crap!</i>

18:04.140 --> 18:07.060
<i>I'm gonna end up somewhere I shouldn't be!</i>

18:07.060 --> 18:08.340
<i>I have to...</i>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.020
<i>I have to do something!</i>

18:14.890 --> 18:16.570
<i>I have to...</i>

18:20.320 --> 18:22.100
<i>do something!</i>

18:28.900 --> 18:29.820
<i>Good, good!</i>

18:29.820 --> 18:30.920
<i>That's it, kitty!</i>

18:31.390 --> 18:34.420
<i>Go settle the matter over there!</i>

18:37.860 --> 18:39.170
<i>Mie-san!</i>

18:39.170 --> 18:40.960
<i>Mie-san, your feet!</i>

18:40.960 --> 18:43.790
<i>Stop staring up at the sky 
when you're looking for a cat!</i>

18:51.120 --> 18:51.980
There it is.

18:53.130 --> 18:55.030
<i>If only I could become a cat...</i>

18:56.730 --> 18:58.940
U-Um, I'm sorry...

18:59.700 --> 19:01.140
I'll say it properly.

19:03.580 --> 19:05.000
<i>R-Right.</i>

19:05.000 --> 19:08.160
<i>There's a serious situation over here.</i>

19:08.160 --> 19:10.580
<i>Thank goodness she noticed 
before I got caught!</i>

19:11.620 --> 19:12.620
What's this?

19:14.130 --> 19:17.100
<i>Mie-san might be oblivious 
to these kinds of things.</i>

19:20.910 --> 19:23.220
<i>She's back to the cat.</i>

19:24.760 --> 19:26.930
<i>Does she not get it?</i>

19:26.930 --> 19:28.470
<i>Or is she not interested?</i>

19:36.250 --> 19:40.610
<i>Supposing I worked up the courage 
to tell her I like her...</i>

19:41.500 --> 19:45.510
<i>Would Mie-san even understand?</i>

19:50.540 --> 19:52.370
S-So...

19:53.440 --> 19:58.730
It might be only one side of 
you that I know, Azuma-kun,

19:58.730 --> 20:01.770
but that was enough for me to fall in love.

20:15.610 --> 20:17.610
<i>Y-You can't, Mie-san!</i>

20:18.390 --> 20:19.610
<i>You can't!</i>

20:19.610 --> 20:21.360
<i>They aren't messing around!</i>

20:22.320 --> 20:25.910
So I want to get to know more about you.

20:28.000 --> 20:28.920
I...

20:33.030 --> 20:36.760
I'm in love with you.

20:45.200 --> 20:47.130
Thanks for telling me.

20:47.130 --> 20:48.480
I'm flattered.

20:54.940 --> 20:55.900
Sorry.

20:56.770 --> 20:59.400
There's someone I like.

21:02.840 --> 21:03.880
Oh.

21:04.780 --> 21:05.710
Okay.

21:08.390 --> 21:09.660
Thanks.

21:11.600 --> 21:13.680
I was about to get in their way.

21:14.590 --> 21:16.850
U-Um...

21:16.850 --> 21:17.730
Sorry about that.

21:18.250 --> 21:19.010
Sorry.

21:19.700 --> 21:22.130
<i>I guess she does get it.</i>

21:22.130 --> 21:23.420
<i>When did she figure it out?</i>

21:29.130 --> 21:32.460
<i>I should go for it too, someday.</i>

21:32.990 --> 21:33.980
<i>For sure.</i>

21:33.980 --> 21:36.450
Oh yeah, I saw a cat.

21:36.450 --> 21:37.020
Eh?

21:37.590 --> 21:39.150
Huh.

23:11.070 --> 23:12.120
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.450 --> 23:14.330
I'm about to do an episode preview.

23:14.330 --> 23:18.290
